      voice: 'gemini:Achird | curious, open-minded economist host who loves a puzzle; warm, thinks aloud, brisk lively pace (never slow, never rushed); takes objections seriously, never preachy #ctx:4tv7gp'
    '|b||The bigger the market, the bigger the prize for being best, so rivals spend more to win it. And once spent, it can''t be got back: it''s sunk.':
